{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/283992a7518b3386c3a2c622dce44fd6.avif?t=1764029153\" width=1126 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Taskbarn?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taskbarn is a cozy idle incremental game that lives quietly on your taskbar or desktop. Raise barn animals as they stroll, graze, and nap while they produce resources that transform into <i>dibbles</i> \u2014 the universal currency used to grow and improve your animals. Whether you\u2019re working, browsing, or gaming, your barn keeps running in the background, always ready to welcome you back with progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/33e3facef58f67084a965c874ea0cd41.poster.avif?t=1764029153\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/33e3facef58f67084a965c874ea0cd41.webm?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/33e3facef58f67084a965c874ea0cd41.mp4?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle on your desktop</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The game is designed to run not only on your taskbar, but anywhere on your monitor, allowing it to blend right into your desktop workflow. The game\u00a0can be freely moved, resized, and tucked wherever it fits best.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Idle</strong>\u00a0\u2013 No constant clicking required. Animals graze, nap, and generate dibbles automatically, even while you\u2019re away. Just check in when you\u2019re ready to spend your earnings and make your animals more efficient!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect &amp; Upgrade Animals</strong> \u2013 Raise chickens, cows, ducks, sheep, pigs, and more. Each produces unique goods that fuel your animals growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low-Impact Performance</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Designed to be lightweight so you can run it in the background while doing other activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System</strong> \u2013 Improve productivity, grazing speed, and sleep recovery to keep your barn bustling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige System</strong> \u2013 When your barn is thriving and your animals are well-fed, begin a New Season to refresh your farm for even greater rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize Your Barn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look of your farm with plenty of options to fit your perfect vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/f64aa81b42bfdb9ee0e98188739e205f.poster.avif?t=1764029153\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/f64aa81b42bfdb9ee0e98188739e205f.webm?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/f64aa81b42bfdb9ee0e98188739e205f.mp4?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle individual visual elements on or off for a minimalist look or a fully decked-out farmstead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/d0e55dcd8928c4b2d0979ece8a004c80.poster.avif?t=1764029153\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/d0e55dcd8928c4b2d0979ece8a004c80.webm?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005830/extras/d0e55dcd8928c4b2d0979ece8a004c80.mp4?t=1764029153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Moooving On Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"Barnyard Billionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"100 Dibbles P/s!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"500 Dibbles P/s!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Dibbles P/s!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/4317c7083d1515617641e3c9f1190aa0c26dda80.jpg"},{"name":"Your first chicken!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/70956d09e36eeafff6039025513ac31303fa65fb.jpg"},{"name":"Your first duck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4005830/dadfc055a53837e47cc202fdf23e7101362f0a36.jpg"},{"name":"Your first sheep!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni